  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solomon Islands 2024 Tertiary Scholarships</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tertiary scholarships are offered to&#xa0;Solomon Islands to progress development and workforce planning objectives. Anticipated outcomes:
&lt;ul&gt;  &lt;li&gt;The capability of scholars is increased&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Scholars develop personal and professional connections to each other&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Increased affinity between New&#xa0;Zealand and scholars through a positive scholarship experience&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Bilateral and regional objectives are supported by the Scholarships Programme&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
